        "text": "Answers\n1.I The map and the filter functions are built-in.\n2.I Standard decorators are the ones without any arguments.\n3.I The generator comprehension is preferred in this case. It is memory efficient as the\nvalues are generated one by one.\n4.I The DataFrame is a representation of tabular data, such as a spreadsheet,\nand is a commonly used object for data analysis using the pandas library.\n5.I When the inplace argument in pandas' library methods is set to True ,\nthe result of the operation is saved to the same DataFrame object on which the\noperation is applied.",
